cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Additionally,
  please cite the underlying paleoclimate data sources listed in data_references.bib
  (27 publications across 32 datasets) and the lipdverse compilation.
title: PReSto Holocene DA Template
abstract: A template repository used by PReSto (Paleoclimate Reconstruction Storehouse)
  to reproduce and customize the Holocene temperature reconstruction of Erb et al.
  (2022) via GitHub Actions. The workflow acquires proxy observations from LiPDverse,
  constructs a model prior from transient climate simulations (HadCM3 and TraCE-21ka),
  and runs offline paleoclimate data assimilation inside containerized environments
  to reconstruct spatially complete temperature fields over the past 12,000 years.
